## Template updates

The Copier answers file records the template version. Update the platform layer with:

```bash
uvx copier update --defaults
```

Review the resulting diff before committing. Application source, dependencies and the README are project-owned and are not overwritten by template updates. Copier's three-way update merges template changes into project-owned `mise.toml` and caller workflows; resolve any conflict markers before committing.
